00018  4B206E            JSUB    CALC    . else calculate value
0001B  0F2068            STA     NUM    . result is stored in reg A
0001E  4B2093            JSUB    SETL0    . I have a problem if last digit is 0, so I need to set a flag if it is
00021  4B20D6            JSUB    RVRSE    . reverse NUM for easier print
00024  4B2104            JSUB    WRITE    . and write value
00027  0320CA            LDA     LAST0    . check I we need to print extra 0
0002A  290000            COMP    #0    
0002D  372120            JGT     PRINT0    
00030  4B2138    PNL     JSUB    PRNTNL    . print new line
00033  3F2FCD            J       LOOP    . repeat until 0
                  
                  
00036  3F2FFD    HALT    J       HALT    
                  
00039  4F0000    RET     RSUB        
                  
